# The FreeCAD release freecad.patch is rebased onto, and the only version it is
# known to apply to. deps/src/freecad is gitignored, so nothing else in this
# repository records which upstream tree the port targets -- the same class of
# uncaptured build-machine state that hid the three force-included headers.
#
# patches/apply.sh reads this and refuses to patch a tree that reports a
# different PACKAGE_VERSION, rather than fuzzily applying to the wrong source.
1.1.3
